                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "bc1a372b-7a5a-4f56-953f-a7f34a9d5c69",
                        "entry_id": "d70b14a0-ebb5-3042-a7bd-4611cacab977",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "short-form"
                        ],
                        "form": "огнемётны"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5585c54a-2667-3f9d-b4c1-b2b799fc62e7",
                        "entry_id": "d70b14a0-ebb5-3042-a7bd-4611cacab977",
                        "glosses": [
                            "воен. связанный, соотносящийся по значению с существительным огнемёт"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c4cb9b0-75f5-42a4-98f5-c22f17dc20ab",
                                "sense_id": "5585c54a-2667-3f9d-b4c1-b2b799fc62e7",
                                "text": "В отряд вошли и огнемётные танки и подрывники."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e4d8b72c-9f9a-3f18-bcfc-e76632a4b0cc",
                        "entry_id": "d70b14a0-ebb5-3042-a7bd-4611cacab977",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. то же, что огнеметательный, предназначенный для метания огня, горящих предметов"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "39c28362-4349-4d32-9b88-ee4ac7b4321f",
                                "sense_id": "e4d8b72c-9f9a-3f18-bcfc-e76632a4b0cc",
                                "text": "❬…❭ воспрещено было каждому раджану, воину, употреблять против неприятеля бесчестное оружие, как, например, палку, заключающую в себе остроконечный клинок, зубчатые стрелы, стрелы, напитанные ядом, и стрелы огнемётные."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d4371d0b-0146-47cc-b3ff-7c73ea0e87b3",
                                "sense_id": "e4d8b72c-9f9a-3f18-bcfc-e76632a4b0cc",
                                "text": "Я с радостью вспомнил, что на ромейских кораблях, что стояли в херсонском порту, не было ни одной огнемётной машины, ни одного сосуда с огненным составом Каллиника."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1b253567-dfc3-32b2-ad69-febb8b3e6d43",
                        "entry_id": "d70b14a0-ebb5-3042-a7bd-4611cacab977",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. способный поразить, ошеломить"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c2c1d49-1a1d-4da6-af7d-2d8d9fb9c0b1",
                                "sense_id": "1b253567-dfc3-32b2-ad69-febb8b3e6d43",
                                "text": "Эта безотказная, огнемётная, бронебойная пьеса сражала наповал любого зрителя."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "07fd7cb4-b4d6-419f-84fa-a3b36b4d7c1b",
                        "source_entry_id": "d70b14a0-ebb5-3042-a7bd-4611cacab977",
                        "source_sense_description": "связанный с огнемётом",
                        "target_lang_word": "flamethrower",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "flamethrower",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "adb43f75-f6c8-37d3-b0f9-e6fa473453a0",
                                        "entry_id": "f1bc0989-a7b3-3e71-9883-f2a615409f9f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A device that projects a flame for starting fires, and sometimes also additional fuel to help ignition. Used either as a weapon or a tool."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b64cf755-7ff4-3f27-b7d9-9876c6ad8567",
                                        "entry_id": "f1bc0989-a7b3-3e71-9883-f2a615409f9f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who is extremely good at throwing or shooting balls."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33b9e95f-61ab-41d8-96aa-405fd1f2ee7f",
                                                "sense_id": "b64cf755-7ff4-3f27-b7d9-9876c6ad8567",
                                                "text": "\"We allowed him to kind of orchestrate the whole offense, and he got comfortable early,\" George said. \"He's a flamethrower. Once he gets hot, it's over.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc42d412-9704-4038-9532-4eca0b4458ae",
                                                "sense_id": "b64cf755-7ff4-3f27-b7d9-9876c6ad8567",
                                                "text": "So when we see guys like that open, we gotta give them the ball. Especially Bryn [Forbes], he's a flamethrower. The guy is one of the best shooters I've been around, so to have him going in the game, it's much needed for us. We need him to get going. We need him to hit shots."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0df79821-8ba8-4e42-8f75-6e9bcf3ae3c6",
                                                "sense_id": "b64cf755-7ff4-3f27-b7d9-9876c6ad8567",
                                                "text": "Unlike steroids, these supposedly illegal substances were not used in secret. There was an understanding that it was in everyone's best interest — pitchers and hitters alike — for today's flamethrowers to have a good grip on the ball."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
